# The `hep-reference` package

Hyperref and cleveref setup with unbreakable references, footnote
back-links and PDF metadata

## Introduction

The `hep-reference` package loads and configures `hyperref`,
`cleveref`, and `footnotebackref` for high-energy physics documents.
It hides and breaks links, fills PDF title and keyword metadata from the
document title data, prevents unwanted line breaks before references and
citations, adds footnote backlinks, and provides helper macros for text
labels, subobject references, and named equation-like references.

Load the package with `\usepackage{hep-reference}`.

